<Prose title="Shipping & Delivery Policy" description="How Sarees Hub plans are delivered." path="/shipping-policy" updated="7 November 2026">
  <p>Sarees Hub sells digital listing plans only. There is no physical shipping.</p>
  <p>Paid plans are activated instantly after successful payment and are visible in your Seller dashboard. If activation is delayed for more than 30 minutes, contact us with your payment ID.</p>
  <p>Sarees bought from shops listed on Sarees Hub are shipped (if at all) by the seller, on terms you agree with them directly.</p>
</Prose>
